@* Reach for this only when the work is not a request. A button that starts an Unpoly request
   already grows its own from .up-active, with no parameter and nothing to clear afterwards. *@
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <Button disabled><Spinner />Saving…</Button>
    <Button Variant="outline" disabled><Spinner />Checking</Button>
    <Button Size="icon" disabled aria-label="Working"><Spinner /></Button>
</div>
